	(text "Pin map = interfaces.SYS. SYS_RST_N lands directly on XRSn (open drain both sides).\n+24V (pins 1-2): this card's regulators and the PORT connector. +24V_GD (pins 3-4): switched by\nsafety channel B on SYS; goes ONLY to the four cell eFuses (cell sheets). The two never meet here.\nETH_CT (77): PHY analog supply to the magnetics centre taps (Ethernet sheet).\nInputs from SYS arrive as S_<name> and reach the MCU as <name> through the buffers."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 167.204 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "41474fb8-2ff5-5930-9ae4-c58c865ec948")
	)
	(text "INPUTS WITH SYS UNPLUGGED"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 179.704 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "73fa632a-0c64-5bfd-bd57-edf24382db02")
	)
	(text "CHB_OK BUFFER (CHANNEL B, OWN PACKAGE)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 135.496 19 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "97af1738-cacf-583c-9357-90850aff17bb")
	)
	(text "SYS CONNECTOR (SYS CONTRACT)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 19 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "a521e1d2-adb1-5b2b-bb5c-ce671adda57a")
	)
	(text "Schmitt buffer with Ioff, separate from the 74LVC244A that carries GATE_EN, so one package\ncannot corrupt both safety channels. 10k pull-down: SYS unplugged = channel B not OK."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 135.496 59.02 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "b99c1caf-0e42-5a17-9f6e-e5affa46509c")
	)
	(text "OUTPUTS WHILE THE MCU IS IN RESET"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 267.624 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "bee89832-30cb-5e41-9e47-87daa9028573")
	)
	(text "SYS makes its own 3.3 V and may drive these lines before this card's VDDIO is up; SPRSP14E 7.1 allows\n+/-20 mA total input-clamp current and 7.10.1.4.2 forbids driving pins early. 74LVC244A inputs and\noutputs are high impedance unpowered (Ioff) and its outputs never exceed VDDIO. tpd ~5 ns."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 262.752 82.14 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "c3a6796b-6e81-5431-a347-e59a9f90a214")
	)
	(text "SYS INPUT BUFFERS (IOFF)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 262.752 19 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "c3aef620-9165-51f0-b3b5-7ee979b5d4a1")
	)
	(text "GPIOs float in reset: CAN TX recessive, RS-485 DE off, DO and FLT_CLR low, SPI chip selects high.\nI2C: 2.2k pull-ups here (bus master side); SYS should not add a second pair."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 343.084 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "d05ae8bc-6b26-5a0e-a2eb-53d6c95eaa30")
	)
	(text "FLT_LATCH_N, GATE_EN, ESTOP_N: 10k to GND, so an unplugged SYS reads as tripped and the gates stay off.\nOther inputs: 100k to their idle level (CAN/SCI receive high, the rest low)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 255.124 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "d899e62b-e2e0-5574-a9f8-6ee7e22e582a")
	)
